<title>JAPAN: Saibo - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Saibo - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.07		vs	    6.42</p>
<p> Operating	  288 million	 vs	  254 million</p>
<p> Current	    328 million	 vs	  267 million</p>
<p> Net		  183 million	 vs	  150 million</p>
<p> EPS		   13.10 yen	  vs	   10.72 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     14 million	  vs	  14 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Saibo Co Ltd is an integrated maker of cotton yarns, cotton fabrics and secondary cotton products.</p>
